  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "First, we simplify the phrase \"$y$ is irrational and it is an irrational number\" to just \"$y$ is irrational.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"$y$ is irrational, or $y$ is irrational or it is a negative number.\"\n\nThen, using the associative law, we can move the comma in the sentence:\n\n\"$y$ is irrational or $y$ is irrational, or it is a negative number.\"\n\nNow, we simplify the phrase \"$y$ is irrational or $y$ is irrational\" to just \"$y$ is irrational.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"$y$ is irrational, or it is a negative number.\"\n\nFinally, we simplify the sentence to\n\n\"$y$ is irrational or negative.\"",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
